      "type": "item",
      "section": "Compute, chips & infrastructure",
      "headline": "Samsung posts 107.44 trillion won quarterly operating profit, up 783.11%, on an HBM4 ramp",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "And the other side of that spending shows up in Korea. Samsung reported quarterly operating profit of 107.44 trillion won, up 783.11% from a year earlier. It said it became the first global technology company to top 100 trillion won in quarterly operating profit." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Driven by memory?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "The memory business set record quarterly revenue and operating profit, which CNBC says was supported by a significant ramp-up in high-bandwidth memory sales and growing demand for server drives. The semiconductor business alone had 147.1 trillion won in revenue." },
