      "headline": "Transcom officials say commercial camera networks plus frontier AI expose US force movements",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "A", "text": "US Transportation Command officials, speaking anonymously at a conference in Grapevine, Texas, said commercial cameras, sensors and tracking tools now make it easier to track service members' patterns of life, and to infer force movements, training schedules and mobilisation plans." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "And AI is the multiplier?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "One official said frontier models and advanced AI help bad actors exploit those data vulnerabilities at a larger scale than before. Another put it this way: I'm really not as concerned about, can you see my tag. The concern is whether someone can link a plate to intent and timing." },
