      "headline": "123 Reg tells customers a September API intrusion was \"the first known AI-driven cyberattack against our company\"",
      "lines": [
        { "host": "B", "text": "The UK domain registrar 123 Reg, which GoDaddy owns, started emailing customers this week. The Register reports it told them their contact information, related customer relationship data, company VAT numbers, and product information pulled through an API were compromised." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "What's the AI part?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "The company described the September 18th intrusion as, in its words, the first known AI-driven cyberattack against our company. A spokesperson said the core attacker infrastructure was hosted in China and Singapore, indicating what they called a strong Chinese nexus." },
