        { "host": "A", "text": "What's the AI part?" },
        { "host": "B", "text": "The company described the September 18th intrusion as, in its words, the first known AI-driven cyberattack against our company. A spokesperson said the core attacker infrastructure was hosted in China and Singapore, indicating what they called a strong Chinese nexus." },
